== minimal-vulkan-ofx: SDK discovery, both memory arrangements, device suite (2026-11-27, Windows) ==
# Machine: Windows, MSVC 14.50, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060, Vulkan 1.4.357 from the
# installed driver. No LunarG SDK installed: a VULKAN_SDK-shaped directory was
# put together from Vulkan-Headers and glslang 16.6.0 so the build scripts'
# discovery path could be measured with the same two pieces the SDK ships.

$ VULKAN_SDK=... build.bat Release          (VULKAN_INCLUDE_DIR/VULKAN_SHADER_COMPILER unset)
      vulkan: headers "...\vk\sdk\Include", shader compiler "...\vk\sdk\Bin\glslc.exe"
  -> configure and build exit 0, no compiler warnings

$ test\run-tests.bat Release nobuild
